   "briefTitle": "A Study of Exercise Endurance and Lung Hyperinflation in Patients With Moderate to Severe Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD)",
   "officialTitle": "A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, Parallel-Group, 6-Week Clinical Study to Assess the Effect of Inhaled Aclidinium Bromide (LAS34273) 200 ug on Exercise Endurance and Lung Hyperinflation in Patients With Moderate to Severe COPD"
  },
